  "configuration_id": "config_011",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only multiprofile models, especially scvi_n200 with avgpool/transformer, are much stronger than single-profile RNA, while image-only single-profile ResNet50 is weak. The key uncertainty is whether the weak image result is due to single-profile representation or inherent lack of image signal. config_011 tests the same ResNet50 encoder with multiprofile avgpool, mirroring the RNA design that improved performance, and provides a clean image-only baseline for later fusion. It is the best next step because it reduces uncertainty about profile/aggregation for image without confounding a new image encoder or jumping to multimodal fusion."
}

